@startuml
title Realtime Pipeline 组件复用与差异边界

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

package "Pipeline 外部共享" #F3F8E8 {
  [RealtimeAgentApp] as App
  [ControlService\n统一控制事件路由] as Control
  [StreamService\n统一stream生命周期] as Stream
  [RealtimeAgentRealtimePipeline\n统一接口] as Contract
}

package "Pipeline 内部可共用" #E8F7E8 {
  [RealtimeAudioNormalizer\n格式适配/重采样/轻量诊断] as Normalizer
  [RealtimeOutputController\n下行水位/输出状态/finish-cancel语义] as Output
  [PipelineEventEmitter\n统一PipelineEvent输出] as Emitter
  [RealtimeTurnState Base\nturn状态/消息buffer/打断标记公共结构] as TurnState
}

package "VisionRealtimePipeline 必须实现" #FFF4E5 {
  [VisionRealtimePipeline] as TextPipeline
  [VisionRealtimeAgentCore\nVision 链路对话语义] as TextCore
  [VisionInputBoundary\nParaformer句子事件解释] as TextBoundary
  [VisionResponseEngine\nText LLM + Streaming TTS] as TextResponse
  [AsrProviderSession\nparaformer-realtime-v2] as Asr
  [VisionModelSession] as LLM
  [TtsProviderSession] as TTS
}

package "OmniRealtimePipeline 必须实现" #E8F2FF {
  [OmniRealtimePipeline] as OmniPipeline
  [OmniAgentCore\nOmni链路对话语义] as OmniCore
  [OmniInputBoundary\nOmni speech事件解释] as OmniBoundary
  [OmniResponseEngine\nOmni音频响应事件解释] as OmniResponse
  [OmniProviderSession\nVAD + ASR + LLM + TTS] as OmniSession
}

App --> Contract
Contract --> TextPipeline : mode=text
Contract --> OmniPipeline : mode=omni

TextPipeline --> Normalizer
TextPipeline --> TextCore
TextPipeline --> Output
TextPipeline --> Emitter
TextCore --> TurnState
TextCore --> TextBoundary
TextCore --> TextResponse
TextBoundary --> Asr
TextResponse --> LLM
TextResponse --> TTS

OmniPipeline --> Normalizer
OmniPipeline --> OmniCore
OmniPipeline --> Output
OmniPipeline --> Emitter
OmniCore --> TurnState
OmniCore --> OmniBoundary
OmniCore --> OmniResponse
OmniBoundary --> OmniSession
OmniResponse --> OmniSession

note right of Contract
外部只能依赖统一接口：
open_session
attach_upstream
attach_downstream
append_input_audio
pause/resume_downstream
prepare_close / close_session
end note

note bottom of Emitter
两个 pipeline 必须输出同一组事件：
session_ready
upstream_ready / downstream_ready
speech_started / speech_stopped
output_audio_delta
output_finished / output_cancel_requested
close_requested / session_closed
end note

note right of Output
RealtimeOutputController 是 pipeline 内部共享抽象。
实现时可以包装或复用现有 OutputService 的
output stream 写入、finish、cancel 和播放回执能力。
它不替代外层 StreamService / ControlService。
end note

note bottom of TextBoundary
Text 差异点：
输入边界来自 Paraformer 句子事件。
sentence_begin -> speech_started
sentence_end/final transcript -> speech_stopped
end note

note bottom of OmniBoundary
Omni 差异点：
输入边界来自 Omni 模型服务 speech 事件。
provider原始事件只能在这里被解释，
不能穿透到外部调用方。
end note

note bottom of TextResponse
Text 回复链路：
final transcript -> Text LLM -> TTS -> output_audio_delta
end note

note bottom of OmniResponse
Omni 回复链路：
Omni 模型服务直接返回音频 delta，
由 OmniResponseEngine 解释成统一输出事件。
end note

@enduml
